'''Morningstar Isle''' (明星おきの島 ''Myōjō-oki no Shima'', '''Morningstar Island''') is the 26th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 75th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|version 9.7]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is a bit harder than [[Pumping Titanium]]. However, none of the stages should give you much trouble, with the exception of the [[No Return Flights]]-esque [[Curry Comet|stage 1]] and possibly [[Meteor Disco|stage 5]].
{{LegendDiff|130|170|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces two new enemies:
*[[Johnnyleon]]: A chameleon with three traits: [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]], [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] and [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]]. He sports extremely high health and Long Distance combined with a low standing range and damage, making him a fast and durable tank.
*[[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]]: An animated enemy base that curses your units for 10 seconds in its extremely expansive range. However, it has a predictable attack animation, deals little to no damage, is often far enough from the [[Cat Base]] to be avoided, and does not have full uptime on its curse effect.

